    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e5450163_b77575a3",
        "filename": "src/encode/BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 150,
      "author": {
        "id": 8704
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-02T22:05:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For `SkEncodedInfo` which is defined in `include/private/SkEncodedInfo.h` and gathered into `include/private:decode_srcs` `skia_filegroup`.  `third_party/skia/src/codec/BUILD.bazel` gathers `include/private:decode_srcs` (together with other things) into `PRIVATE_CODEC_HEADERS` which are then packaged up as `hdrs` of `//src/codec:any_decoder` target.\n\nI hope that it\u0027s okay to reuse `SkEncodedInfo` here, but maybe there is another way to represent (Rgb, Rgba, Gray, GrayAlpha) x (bpp\u003d8 or bpp\u003d16)?  FWIW it is also convenient to be able to use `SkEncodedInfo::bitsPerPixel`.",
      "parentUuid": "42d6468f_7342a561",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 150,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 150,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "ce66b36ae4999c9d47a317b74497349f47048be5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e39cebcd_180103d1",
        "filename": "src/encode/BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 150,
      "author": {
        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-02T22:12:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SkEncodedInfo.h appears to be a pure header (which are ok to include in multiple libraries), so we should probably split it into something like include/private:encoded_info (a `filegroup`) and have it be used in both srcs of the skia_cc_library rules, rather than drawing a dependency arrow from encode -\u003e decode",
      "parentUuid": "e5450163_b77575a3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 150,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 150,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "ce66b36ae4999c9d47a317b74497349f47048be5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a76ff53d_635c5b10",
        "filename": "src/encode/BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 150,
      "author": {
        "id": 8704
